{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00038",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.51,
      "end_seconds": 4.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. It's my turn, I think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.52,
      "end_seconds": 10.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.34,
      "end_seconds": 18.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "I wanted to get a tight band-like headache looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.3,
      "end_seconds": 23.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Okay, how far back does it go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.98,
      "end_seconds": 33.92,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "Uh, about... well, two years. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.85,
      "end_seconds": 44.22,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind. It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.61,
      "end_seconds": 73.8,
      "duration_seconds": 28.19,
      "text": "Rest helps a bit. About a three out of ten. It's a couple of times a week. It's the not knowing that gets to me. And there's trouble sleeping as well, nearly five years now. About trouble sleeping, it feels mild to me. And there's tired eyes as well, two months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.53,
      "end_seconds": 78.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.27,
      "end_seconds": 81.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.09,
      "end_seconds": 87.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.16,
      "end_seconds": 100.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "The muscles at the back of your neck are tight and tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.21,
      "end_seconds": 108.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.76,
      "end_seconds": 130.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Right, any blurred vision or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.02,
      "end_seconds": 134.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Um, no, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.95,
      "end_seconds": 141.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Any jaw pain when chewing or weakness at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.23,
      "end_seconds": 145.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.83,
      "end_seconds": 149.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.62,
      "end_seconds": 151.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.87,
      "end_seconds": 157.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.5,
      "end_seconds": 160.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.13,
      "end_seconds": 179.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.6,
      "end_seconds": 193.06,
      "duration_seconds": 11.46,
      "text": "Well, yes, latex. I've no idea what the reaction was, only that I'm not supposed to have it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.26,
      "end_seconds": 198.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.46,
      "end_seconds": 209.91,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about a year. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.52,
      "end_seconds": 221.84,
      "duration_seconds": 10.32,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure is known to us, good to have that clear. Tell me what you take day to day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.35,
      "end_seconds": 230.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "Losartan. I take it 50 milligrams, maybe, once a day for my blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.72,
      "end_seconds": 236.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.85,
      "end_seconds": 252.05,
      "duration_seconds": 14.2,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. Combiflam, most days. Right, I had telmisartan at one point, but I'm off it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.82,
      "end_seconds": 255.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.91,
      "end_seconds": 259.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "I don't drink at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.12,
      "end_seconds": 261.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.52,
      "end_seconds": 269.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.83,
      "end_seconds": 273.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Are you working or retired?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.97,
      "end_seconds": 278.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Retired. I stopped a few years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.91,
      "end_seconds": 282.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Do you exercise at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.84,
      "end_seconds": 290.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "I go to the gym a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.87,
      "end_seconds": 295.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Who do you live with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.66,
      "end_seconds": 302.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "I live with my family, my husband and two kids."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.84,
      "end_seconds": 306.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.54,
      "end_seconds": 310.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "No, uh, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.37,
      "end_seconds": 327.74,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with a tension-type headache at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.63,
      "end_seconds": 332.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Is this something I'll have for good?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.05,
      "end_seconds": 345.13,
      "duration_seconds": 12.08,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a tension-type headache. For this, amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, for six weeks. It's for headache prevention."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.03,
      "end_seconds": 349.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Alright, you know, I'll collect it today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.72,
      "end_seconds": 363.19,
      "duration_seconds": 11.47,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Alright, I'll see you out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.61,
      "end_seconds": 370.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Hmm, one thing: no, actually that's all. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.62,
      "end_seconds": 371.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}